<title>FRANCE: Alcatel says gearing level &quot;honourable&quot;.</title>
<headline>Alcatel says gearing level &quot;honourable&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>French industrial group Alcatel Alsthom said it had reduced its debts by 6.9 billion francs and reduced its gearing to 32 percent at the end of 1996 from 61 percent at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>Finance director Jean-Pierre Halbron told a news conference that the gearing level was &quot;more than honourable&quot; for Alcatel's industry and compared to other French companies.</p>
</text>
